<MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Align="Align.Center">Student Assistant Projects</MudText>

<MudDivider Class="my-3" />

<MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Align="Align.Justify">
	These are the projects I worked on during my student job at the Technical University of Munich's Chair for Augmented Medical Procedures & Augmented Reality (CAMPAR) or more precisely, its research group "Forschungsgruppe Augmented Reality" (FAR).
	My tasks there revolved around expanding, optimizing, and maintaining older projects, such mobile apps, custom made Bluetooth gadgets/research tools, and VR studies.<br />
	Sadly, I'm not able to provide a lot of images, since many of the projects have not been made publically available (at least for free). However, I will link research papers & publications where appropriate.
</MudText>

